    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just so quiet now. like, actually quiet. i look at my phone and there’s nothing. no notifications, no mentions, no one even talking about me anymore. it feels like i didn't just lose my job or my followers... it feels like i actually ceased to exist. like the person everyone knew is just... gone. deleted. i'm just sitting here in this room and i don't even feel real anymore.",
